{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45176","headline":"送柳淡扶侍赴洪州 · 皎然","name":"送柳淡扶侍赴洪州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中林许师友，忽阻夙心期。\n自顾青緺好，来将黄鹤辞。\n少年轻远涉，世道得无欺。\n烟雨孤舟上，晨昏千里时。\n离魂渺天末，相望在江湄。\n无限江南柳，春风卷乱丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}